02:49.041 --> 02:51.541
<b>CITY Z</b>

02:49.041 --> 02:51.541
<b>HERO ASSOCIATION OFFICE</b>

02:54.381 --> 02:57.051
<b>Ah, you must be Genos?</b>

02:58.091 --> 03:00.391
<b>My name is Bang.</b>

03:00.391 --> 03:01.801
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

03:02.261 --> 03:05.891
<b><i>Bang, Class S rank 3, a.k.a. "Silverfang."</i></b>

03:06.391 --> 03:08.311
<b><i>His skill is the real deal.{He possesses true skill.}</i></b>

03:09.151 --> 03:11.651
<b>The Association called me in.</b>

03:11.651 --> 03:14.441
<b>Everyone's at the headquarters.</b>

03:14.901 --> 03:17.151
<b>This little branch office is empty right now.</b>

03:17.151 --> 03:19.911
<b>The call to assemble went out 
to all S-class heroes,{All of the S-class heroes got the call to come here,}{The call went out to all S-class heroes to assemble here,}{Each of the Class S heroes got the call to come here,}</b>

03:19.911 --> 03:22.281
<b>but we're the only ones who showed up.</b>

03:22.701 --> 03:23.991
<b>Why is that?</b>

03:24.541 --> 03:28.161
<b>Too far away, or perhaps they're busy.</b>

03:28.871 --> 03:32.841
<b>{Of course, }Some of the more cold-blooded 
ones simply don't bother.</b>

03:32.841 --> 03:34.881
<b>After all, we're only called up</b>

03:34.881 --> 03:38.721
<b>when there's some impossible problem they want us to handle.</b>

03:39.551 --> 03:41.641
<b>Today's no exception.</b>

03:42.351 --> 03:46.391
<b>The threat level is Dragon, a worst-case scenario.</b>

03:46.771 --> 03:51.101
<b>35 minutes from now, 
a huge meteor will impact{strike} City Z.</b>

03:51.101 --> 03:55.441
<b>The call to arms was to see whether any nearby S-class heroes can do any{some}thing about it.{They are asking if nearby Class S heroes can do anything about it.}</b>

03:56.151 --> 03:57.531
<b>A meteor?</b>

03:57.531 --> 03:59.901
<b>Apparently, it suddenly changed trajectory{paths}.</b>

03:59.901 --> 04:02.911
<b>{That means}This is the end for us.</b>

04:03.241 --> 04:05.581
<b>The impact will wipe out City Z.</b>

04:07.081 --> 04:09.791
<b>I'm afraid there's nothing we can do this time.</b>

04:09.791 --> 04:12.711
<b>You should consider{think about} evacuating {with }your loved ones as well.</b>

04:13.331 --> 04:15.001
<b>Do the citizens know?</b>

04:15.551 --> 04:21.471
<b>I was told they would estimate the impact area and issue evacuation orders 30 minutes before it hits.</b>

04:23.391 --> 04:27.721
<b><i>Attention! This is an announcement from the Hero Association.</i></b>

04:29.021 --> 04:30.481
<b>Panic is sure to ensue.{People are sure to panic.}</b>

04:31.061 --> 04:32.521
<b>And you, old man?</b>

04:32.521 --> 04:33.731
<b>"Old man," is it?</b>

04:34.111 --> 04:36.151
<b>Call me Bang.</b>

04:36.151 --> 04:38.151
<b>Are you not evacuating?</b>

04:38.151 --> 04:40.951
<b>My dojo has been in my family for generations.</b>

04:40.951 --> 04:42.991
<b>I cannot abandon it.</b>

04:45.621 --> 04:47.791
<b>"Rock-Crushing Fist of Flowing Water."</b>

04:47.791 --> 04:48.871
<b>Heard of it?</b>

04:51.501 --> 04:52.671
<b>He left…</b>

04:55.881 --> 04:58.171
<b><i>Emergency evacuation warning.</i></b>

04:58.171 --> 05:00.421
<b><i>Threat level: Dragon.{The threat level is Dragon.}</i></b>

05:00.421 --> 05:03.261
<b><i>Evacuate immediately.</i></b>

05:03.261 --> 05:07.391
<b><i>21 minutes until meteor impact.</i></b>

05:07.391 --> 05:10.311
<b><i>Experts predict total destruction of City Z.{Taken from manga, no idea what it actually says aside from mentioning city Z}</i></b>

05:09.141 --> 05:10.311
<b>It's huge…</b>

05:10.311 --> 05:15.271
<b><i>Evacuate as quickly and as far as possible.{Taken from manga, no idea what it actually says}</i></b>

05:10.311 --> 05:12.481
<b>No way we can escape that.</b>

05:16.731 --> 05:21.031
<b><i>So many people have given up hope of survival.</i></b>

05:21.031 --> 05:22.821
<b><i>It is not just City Z that is in danger.</i></b>

05:23.071 --> 05:25.201
<b><i>Neighboring cities will also be damaged{sustain damage}.</i></b>

05:26.071 --> 05:27.701
<b><i>It is too late to evacuate.</i></b>

05:29.991 --> 05:32.371
<b>I did not expect to test{be testing} this prototype so soon!</b>

05:51.601 --> 05:55.941
<b><i>Let me see if a blast from my incineration cannon at full power will do the trick.</i></b>

05:56.651 --> 05:58.861
<b><i>Master Saitama lives here too.</i></b>

05:59.481 --> 06:01.481
<b><i>I cannot possibly evacuate without him.</i></b>

06:05.991 --> 06:06.571
<b>Is that…?</b>

06:19.041 --> 06:20.921
<b>You are Bofoi, correct?</b>

06:22.171 --> 06:24.171
<b>And you are the new boy, Genos.</b>

06:24.881 --> 06:27.091
<b>Come to stop the meteor?</b>

06:27.091 --> 06:27.761
<b>Yes.</b>

06:28.761 --> 06:29.601
<b><i>Class S, rank 7.{Seventh in Class S.}</i></b>

06:30.351 --> 06:34.771
<b><i>A hero who uses {intense}{overwhelming}raw firepower to 
obliterate his opponents and everything nearby.</i></b>

06:34.771 --> 06:37.021
<b><i>Does he also live in City Z?</i></b>

06:37.021 --> 06:39.441
<b><i>Or did he rush here, putting his life at risk?</i></b>

06:40.151 --> 06:42.821
<b>Bofoi, I need your help.</b>

06:42.821 --> 06:43.941
<b>I refuse.</b>

06:43.941 --> 06:45.321
<b>Why?</b>

06:45.321 --> 06:49.371
<b>I am only here{only came} to field test my new weapon.</b>

06:49.371 --> 06:51.081
<b>The meteor is a perfect target.</b>

06:51.701 --> 06:53.041
<b>A test?</b>

06:53.041 --> 06:55.621
<b>If that meteor hits, you too will die.</b>

06:55.621 --> 06:56.911
<b>I will not.</b>

06:56.911 --> 06:57.371
<b>What?</b>

06:58.041 --> 07:02.381
<b>You are currently talking to a 
remotely controlled drone.{What you are talking to right now is a remotely-controlled drone.}</b>

07:03.301 --> 07:06.261
<b>Sorry to disappoint you, 
but my life's not at stake here.</b>

07:07.341 --> 07:11.181
<b>Also, do not call me Bofoi. 
I am Metal Knight.</b>

07:11.181 --> 07:14.391
<b>Heroes call each other by their hero names, 
not their real names.{bang is a friend indeed}</b>

07:14.391 --> 07:15.851
<b>Everyone knows that.</b>

07:17.101 --> 07:20.861
<b>Looks like it's time to end our little chat.</b>

07:26.321 --> 07:27.111
<b>All right!</b>

07:28.821 --> 07:30.621
<b>Launching missiles!{Firing missiles!}</b>

07:34.991 --> 07:36.001
<b><i>Metal Knight?</i></b>

07:38.791 --> 07:41.461
<b><i>I cannot fire with his missiles in the way.</i></b>

07:54.681 --> 07:56.141
<b><i>Amazing.</i></b>

07:56.141 --> 07:57.351
<b><i>Such destructive power.</i></b>

07:58.271 --> 07:59.641
<b><i>This hero is dangerous.</i></b>

07:59.641 --> 08:01.601
<b><i>I must be wary.</i></b>

08:11.571 --> 08:14.121
<b>Not quite potent enough, eh?</b>

08:16.041 --> 08:18.251
<b><i>33 seconds {left }until impact.</i></b>

08:19.121 --> 08:21.331
<b><i>To fire my incineration cannon at full power,</i></b>

08:21.331 --> 08:23.251
<b><i>it needs five seconds to charge.{I need five seconds to charge it with my body's energy.}{cps}</i></b>

08:24.291 --> 08:27.971
<b><i>But the target is already bearing down on us{close}.</i></b>

08:27.971 --> 08:30.881
<b><i>Not to mention, if I do take it out, what then?</i></b>

08:30.881 --> 08:34.101
<b><i>The meteor may break apart and still cause a disaster.</i></b>

08:34.101 --> 08:37.181
<b><i>But{ first,} will my weapons even be powerful enough to stop it?</i></b>

08:37.181 --> 08:40.351
<b><i>Metal Knight's countless missiles had no effect.</i></b>

08:41.481 --> 08:43.101
<b>Calm yourself.{First off, be calm.}</b>

08:43.651 --> 08:45.901
<b>I can tell{see} you've lost your composure.</b>

08:45.901 --> 08:50.611
<b>You're far too young to be worried about failure.</b>

08:50.611 --> 08:54.281
<b>When your back's up against the wall, 
just muddle through.</b>

08:54.281 --> 08:55.741
<b>The outcome won't change.</b>

08:55.741 --> 08:57.831
<b>So that's the best thing to do{what is best}.</b>

08:59.331 --> 09:01.251
<b><i>Muddling through is best?</i></b>

09:10.381 --> 09:10.921
<b><i>He is right.</i></b>

09:12.551 --> 09:15.051
<b><i>If the outcome will not change,</i></b>

09:17.301 --> 09:21.351
<b><i>{then I }how can I die without giving it my all?</i></b>

09:23.021 --> 09:24.601
<b>Bang, get down!</b>

09:25.351 --> 09:25.941
<b>Oh.{what is he saying}</b>

09:26.611 --> 09:29.651
<b><i>I will no longer think about failure or repercussions!</i></b>

09:29.651 --> 09:32.281
<b><i>I will just pour everything I have…</i></b>

09:32.281 --> 09:33.491
<b><i>into one last shot!</i></b>

09:46.421 --> 09:47.591
<b>Damn, no effect!{Dammit, it's not working!}</b>

09:47.961 --> 09:51.421
<b>No, I think I see the meteor being pushed back.</b>

09:51.421 --> 09:52.971
<b>Really?</b>

09:52.971 --> 09:54.841
<b>Oh, no. It was just my imagination.</b>

09:54.841 --> 09:56.051
<b>Stupid geezer{You old fool}!</b>

09:59.181 --> 10:01.721
<b><i>So this… will be my grave.{is where I'll meet my end.}</i></b>

10:12.861 --> 10:14.571
<b>Nine more seconds.</b>

10:15.151 --> 10:17.321
<b>Get out of here, Bang.</b>

10:17.991 --> 10:20.371
<b>{Old man}{Hey geezer}{Yo, Gramps}Hey mister, take care of Genos.</b>

10:26.371 --> 10:29.381
<b>Wh-Who are you?</b>

10:30.381 --> 10:32.881
<b>I'm just your average hero.{I'm just a guy who's a hero (for fun).}{I figure it's important that he omits "shumide", which in my preferred rendition of the full catchphrase corresponds to "for fun."}{honestly I kinda wish that no single TL of the catchphrase caught on, so changing it around would be a more reasonable thing to do}{also notable that this is the first time he says it since registering, i.e. it's officially no longer purely a hobby}</b>

10:45.431 --> 10:46.311
<b>Master?!</b>

10:49.231 --> 10:50.821
<b>You're not…</b>

10:52.821 --> 10:54.361
<b>gonna fall on…</b>

10:55.441 --> 10:56.071
<b>my town!</b>

11:08.251 --> 11:10.131
<b>He shattered it!</b>

11:10.131 --> 11:11.711
<b>Unbelievable!</b>

11:12.251 --> 11:12.881
<b>But…</b>

11:23.511 --> 11:24.511
<b>It's collapsing!</b>

11:25.771 --> 11:27.141
<b><i>It's not just this building.{all signs point to this being thoughts. his mouth isn't moving in this shot, he's not NECESSARILY talking to genos, and in the manga this isn't in word bubbles}</i></b>

11:27.851 --> 11:31.731
<b><i>The destruction is spreading throughout the whole city.</i></b>

11:40.201 --> 11:41.741
<b>Guess that settles that.</b>

11:54.291 --> 11:56.811
<b>THREE DAYS LATER</b>

11:56.011 --> 12:00.681
<b><i>Although City Z was able to avoid total destruction,</i></b>

12:00.681 --> 12:07.101
<b><i>the city was still devastated, with the effects of the meteor fragments visible everywhere.</i></b>

