12:13.691 --> 12:16.151
<b>If you and Metal Knight worked together,</b>

12:16.151 --> 12:18.571
<b>the damage could have been minimized.</b>

12:19.491 --> 12:23.111
<b>But that Metal Knight guy wasn't interested in helping, right?</b>

12:24.031 --> 12:25.881
<b>So stop worrying about it.</b>

12:25.881 --> 12:28.161
<b>I think we kept the damage to a minimum.</b>

12:28.161 --> 12:29.951
<b>After all, no one died.</b>

12:30.871 --> 12:32.161
<b><i>He is right.</i></b>

12:32.161 --> 12:35.711
<b><i>Master's punch killed the meteor's momentum.</i></b>

12:36.671 --> 12:41.211
<b><i>Theoretically, the shockwaves from the meteor 
would have annihilated everything.</i></b>

12:41.881 --> 12:44.231
<b><i>Stopping it was nothing short of a miracle.</i></b>

12:44.231 --> 12:48.061
<b><i>I would not be surprised if people 
talk about Master for years to come,</i></b>

12:48.061 --> 12:50.601
<b><i>praising him as a courageous man.</i></b>

12:50.601 --> 12:53.521
<b><i>But Master has no idea.</i></b>

12:53.521 --> 12:58.321
<b><i>Some of the public is even 
making him out to be the bad guy</i></b>

12:58.321 --> 13:00.021
<b><i>for causing the partial destruction of City Z.</i></b>

13:01.571 --> 13:04.111
<b><i>No, I should not mention it.</i></b>

13:04.111 --> 13:05.031
<b>By the way,</b>

13:05.701 --> 13:08.581
<b>do you think we moved up in the rankings?</b>

13:08.581 --> 13:10.121
<b>Yes, we did.</b>

13:10.791 --> 13:13.541
<b>I went from Class S rank 17 to 16.</b>

13:13.541 --> 13:16.131
<b>Metal Knight also moved up from rank 7 to 6.</b>

13:16.751 --> 13:21.001
<b>Master, you shot up in Class C, 
from rank 342 to rank 5.</b>

13:22.021 --> 13:23.381
<b><i>Five?!</i></b>

13:23.381 --> 13:26.181
<b>From 342 to 5? What the hell?!</b>

13:26.181 --> 13:27.971
<b>That's crazy!</b>

13:28.351 --> 13:29.391
<b>Not at all.</b>

13:29.391 --> 13:33.561
<b>Your performance was worthy of Class A or even Class S.</b>

13:33.561 --> 13:36.481
<b>After all, it was a Dragon-level threat.</b>

13:37.021 --> 13:37.941
<b>Yeah?</b>

13:37.941 --> 13:39.521
<b>If there had been no damage,</b>

13:39.521 --> 13:41.901
<b>I am sure you would be ranked fifth in Class S{at Class S rank 5}.</b>

13:43.491 --> 13:47.871
<b>Smashing the meteor alone was worthy of Class A.</b>

13:47.871 --> 13:51.161
<b>But I think the Hero Association assumed that</b>

13:51.161 --> 13:55.751
<b>Metal Knight and I played a bigger role.</b>

13:55.751 --> 14:00.381
<b>By the way, they always report threat levels 
as "demon" or "tiger" or whatever.</b>

14:00.841 --> 14:02.131
<b>Do they {actually }mean anything?{cps}</b>

14:03.831 --> 14:04.631
<b>They do.</b>

